Assuming it hasn't been done already (the nethack cliche, I know), the 
next version should include a 'purple dinosaur'. 

The purple dinosaur has a lawful alignment, is sleep resistant, has an
extremely low AC, and has no means of attacking, other than singing.

 You hit the purple dinosaur!
 The purple dinosaur sings!
 You feel deathly sick.
 You begin vomiting uncontrollably!

If you attempt to chat with one, well, you can guess what he'd say.

Also, the dungeon should be littered with plastic purple dinosaur figurines.

And so forth.


